    "product": {
      "type": "product-template",
      "blocks": {
        "custom_hHXrPB": {
          "type": "custom",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Refund Policy",
            "content": "<h3>Refund & Return Policy</h3>\n<strong>Due to the proprietary nature of this program, there are no refunds.</strong>\n\n<p>You can always contact us with any questions at support@yourcolorstyle.com.</p>"
          }
        },
        "custom_MPaAF8": {
          "type": "custom",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQs",
            "content": "<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">I have more questions. Who can I talk to?</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://scheduler.zoom.us/jennifer-vax/info-call\" target=\"blank\">Schedule a 30-minute info call with Jen Vax</a></p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">What is included with my enrollment fee?</h3><p>Unlimited access to the online curriculum, the digital resources (digital color palettes, color guides, draping charts), access to the private Facebook group, two 30-minute 1:1 coaching sessions with Jen, certification, ongoing mentorship and feedback, 25% trade discount on color palette postcard prints. You will have access to the above for as long as you are active in the program.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Is this seasonal color analysis?</h3>\n<p>No. This program will teach you color analysis based on color theory. My goal is to teach you how to identify a person's coloring and tone through a simple 3-step process. You will then know their best color palette to recommend colors from. How you choose to present this color palette to your client is up to you. You can choose to call it the simple name we give it which describes the types of colors that person should wear or you can choose to call it something else. Our color palettes do not map 1:1 to seasons because they are designed to be easily customized based on a person's unique coloring.</p>\n<p>Color analysis is not about finding a person's season. It is about identifying their most flattering colors and understanding WHY. </p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">How long does it take to get certified in color analysis?</h3>\n<p>The program is self-paced, allowing you to complete it in as little as a few weeks or take your time to master the material. Most students become certified within 4-6 weeks while practicing on clients.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Do I need prior experience to take this course?</h3>\n<p>No experience? No problem! Our Color Analysis Certification is designed for beginners and professionals alike. If you love color and enjoy helping people feel confident, you’re in the right place.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">How much can I earn as a Certified Color Analyst?</h3>\n<p>Certified Color Analysts typically charge between $150 to $500 per session, depending on their expertise and location. Many professionals incorporate color analysis into styling, makeup, and personal shopping services to boost their income.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Is this Color Analysis Certification recognized in the industry?</h3>\n<p>Yes! Your Color Style™ Certification is a trusted and industry-recognized program, used by stylists, image consultants, and beauty professionals worldwide. Upon completion, you’ll receive an official certification badge to display on your website and social media.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Can I do color analysis online, or is it an in-person service?</h3>\n<p>Yes, you can offer both in-person and virtual color analysis services! Our program teaches you how to conduct color analysis using client photos, making it easy to work with clients worldwide.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">What makes Your Color Style™ Certification different from other programs?</h3>\n<p>Unlike outdated seasonal color systems, Your Color Style™ teaches a modern, science-backed approach to color analysis. We also provide:\n✔️ Ongoing access so you can revisit materials anytime\n✔️ Support & expert guidance from industry leader Jen Vax</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">What is a Color Analysis Certification?</h3>\n<p>A Color Analysis Certification is a professional training program that teaches you how to analyze an individual’s natural coloring and determine their most flattering color palette. This certification enables you to offer color analysis as a paid service, helping clients choose clothing, makeup, and accessories that enhance their appearance.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Who should take this Color Analysis Certification program?</h3>\n<p>This certification is perfect for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stylists & Image Consultants looking to enhance their services</li>\n<li>Makeup Artists who want to recommend the best shades for clients</li>\n<li>Boutique Owners & Retailers interested in increasing customer confidence and sales</li>\n<li>Personal Color Enthusiasts who want to turn their passion into a business</li>\n<li>Anyone who loves color and wants to build a profitable career in personal styling!</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">What will I learn in the Color Analysis Certification program?</h3>\n<p>Our step-by-step training covers:\n✅ How to determine skin undertones, chroma, and contrast\n✅ A modern approach to color analysis (beyond seasonal color typing!)\n✅ How to use color drapes and digital tools effectively\n✅ Practical exercises with real client case studies\n✅ How to turn color analysis into a successful business\n\nUpon completion, you’ll receive an official certification to showcase your expertise!</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Why do you have a monthly payment option?</h3>\n<p>The monthly payment option allows you to access the program in a budget friendly way. It also takes the pressure off of a larger upfront investment.</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Can I just take the course, for now, and decide to get certified later?</h3>\n<p>Yes. We offer a curriculum only path without the pressure of assignment reviews and certification. You can <a href=\"/products/color-consultant-training-library\">enroll in the Color Consultant Training Library</a> and decide to upgrade to certification later.\n\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">What materials do I need to complete this program?</h3>\n<p>You will need Adobe Photoshop (if you plan on learning online color analysis) and Google Drive. We will be using Photoshop to color adjust the photographs and to perform the virtual draping. We will be using Google Slides to create our client e-books. You will need a GMAIL account to access Google Drive and its tools.</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">What happens if I cancel my subscription?</h3><p>The monthly payment plan is not a subscription. It is a commitment to pay for the program over the course of 12 months.</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">What is your refund policy?</h3>\n<p>Due to the proprietary nature of the content, there is no refund available. If you are unsure of your level of commitment, please schedule an info call.</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">What if I have zero experience with color analysis or with business?</h3>\n<p>Every student that enters this program comes with a different level of experience. There are some that have zero experience with color analysis and business. Some that have existing businesses and are adding color analysis to their services. Some have limited to computer skills. No matter what your level of experience, you will be successful in this program.</p>\n\n\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Do I still have to pay monthly once I'm certified?</h3>\n<p>Yes. Your monthly payment is a commitment to paying 12 payments of $197. Then you will pay a $500/annual fee. Your annual fee gives you continued access to me, updates to digital materials, updates to processes, your 25% trade discount, the private group and the curriculum. If you paid for a full year upfront, you will pay an annual $500 fee at the end of your year.</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Do you offer a payment plan?</h3>\n<p>You can pay monthly for a total of 12 months.</p>\n\n\n\n\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">What other fees will I owe Your Color Style?</h3><p>You will be prompted at the end of your year or enrollment to pay an annual $500 fee for continued access.</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Do you teach me how to build a website and market my business?</h3>\n<p>I do not teach you how to build a website, but I will share with you resources to help you get started. Upon request, I will offer web site reviews, online marketing suggestions, best business practices, how to handle client scenarios and more.</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">How do I enroll in the Color Analysis Certification program?</h3>\n<p>Enrolling is easy! Click the Add to Cart  button, complete your registration, and get instant access to your training. Start today and begin your journey to becoming a Certified Color Analyst! </p>"
          }
        },
